# Consumer archive boundary.
#
# The Git repository keeps tests, benchmarks, engineering documentation and
# release tooling. They are not part of the source package consumed by DUB or
# by a git-archive consumer.
.github/ export-ignore
benchmark/ export-ignore
tests/ export-ignore
tools/ export-ignore
docs/ export-ignore

AGENTS.md export-ignore
CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
BENCHMARK.md export-ignore
DESIGN.md export-ignore
RESEARCH.md export-ignore
ROADMAP.md export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
